#001 Filter film by ISO and format

Precondition: User is on Home page

Steps to reproduce:
1. On Home page tap “Buy”
2. Select Film category
3. Select Format = 35 mm
4. Select ISO = 200
5. Wait for product list to be updated

Expected result:
* Product list is updated according to selected filters
* All displayed products contain Format = 35 mm
* All displayed products contain ISO = 200
* Product list is not empty

#002 Verify cart counter after adding different product types (film + camera)

Precondition: User is on Home page

Steps to reproduce:
1. On Home page tap “Buy”
2. Open Film category
3. Add any film product to cart
4. Return to Home page
5. Tap “Buy”
6. Open Camera category
7. Add any camera product to cart

Expected result:
* Cart counter is displayed
* Cart counter equals 2
* Cart contains two different product types:
    * one film
    * one camera
* Each product is displayed as a separate cart item

#003 View results of search

Precondition: User is on Home page

Steps to reproduce:
1. Tap Search icon on Home page
2. Search bar opens
3. Enter “kodak” into the search input field
4. Submit the search (tap Enter)
5. Observe the displayed search results

Expected result / Assertions:
* Search results page is displayed
* All listed products contain “kodak” in the name
* Product list is not empty
* Search input retains the entered text “kodak”
* Search results are relevant to the query

